The '''Security Hall''' is an [[Location]] found in the {{Zone|Community Center}}. Players above {{SkyBlock Level|10}} can access the '''Security Hall''' after talking to {{NPCSprite|Susan}}.

{{ZoneText}}

== Overview ==
The '''Security Hall''' serves as a place where players can learn about account safety.

Players cannot send or receive chat messages while inside the '''Security Hall'''. Attempting to chat provides the message:
{{Dialogue|
&cThe chat is silenced while you're in the Security Hall!
&cExit the Security Hall to resume chatting.
}}

